<title>USA: Supreme Intl sees record Q1, year.</title>
<headline>Supreme Intl sees record Q1, year.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Supreme International Corp expects a record performance in the fiscal 1998 first quarter and full year, President and Chief Operating Officer Oscar Feldenkreis said Tuesday.</p>
<p>So far, results for the first quarter, begun February 1, are in line with expectations, he said.</p>
<p>He did not specify whether the expectations were analysts' or the company's. Officials at the company were not available for comment.</p>
</text>
